# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file; it is not served.
#
# A hashed file never changes under its name, so a browser keeps it for a year and never asks again.
# The app is served under `/app` on `app.brain.dog`, so its hashed files are too.
#
# THE FONTS ARE HASHED BY THEIR ADDRESS. `tokens.css` and the shell ask for each one with `?v=` and
# the first four hex of the file's SHA-256 (`src/lib/fonts.test.ts` holds them equal), so a new font
# is a new address and the old one may be kept for a year like a chunk.
#
# Everything else (the shell, the marks) keeps the platform's default, so a deploy is seen on the
# next load.
/app/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/app/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
